【Third-Party APIs and Data Sources】

This service utilizes the JSON API v2 provided by P2PQuake.

Earthquake information, tsunami information, earthquake early warnings, and other externally supplied data are subject to the applicable terms of use
and licenses established by their respective providers.

Information issued by the Japan Meteorological Agency is obtained through P2PQuake and may be processed or visualized to accommodate the presentation
format of NEiN.

IDIO claims no exclusive ownership over externally supplied data.

Data Provider:
