【Disclaimer】

NEiN is intended to provide disaster-related information and support informed decision-making. It is not an official service of any government agency,
the Japan Meteorological Agency, local authorities, or P2PQuake.

The accuracy, completeness, timeliness, continuity, and availability of the information provided are not guaranteed.

Information may be delayed, incomplete, or inaccurate due to communication failures, external API outages, system malfunctions, or other circumstances.

In the event of a disaster, users should prioritize official information issued by the Japan Meteorological Agency, local authorities, and other relevant
institutions.

To the extent permitted by applicable law, IDIO shall not be held liable for damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, this service.

